OL,3,GNEWSATeen thanks Children in Need for
OL,4,Aholiday club
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage girl from Bramhall has
OL,7,Fthanked BBC Children in Need for
OL,8,Fhelping to fund a school holiday club
OL,9,Ffor students with learning
OL,10,Fdifficulties.
OL,12,FThe CADS (Children's Activities and
OL,13,FDisabled Sports) programme is run by
OL,14,FStockport-based charity the Seashell
OL,15,FTrust.
OL,17,FGrace Wilson, 14, with cerebral palsy,
OL,18,Fattends the sessions. She said: "I do
OL,19,Fbikes, drumming and swimming. Without
OL,20,Fit, I'd just chill around the house.
